  notes: 'Optional young-man and work-unit conversation. Source: HEARTH_Full_Game_Script_Expanded_Native_English_Lobby_Mia_Commentary.md,
    Scene 1.1. Text is synchronized by Tools/Hearth/Dialogue/Sync All Dialogue From
    Final Script.'
  lines:
  - startDelay: 0.15
    speaker: Work Unit
    text: 'This section''s solid. One small thing: in the second paragraph, ''in
      summary'' sounds more formal than ''anyway.'''
    holdSeconds: 7.565094
    voiceClip: {fileID: 0}
    durationMode: 0
    voiceTailSeconds: 0.12
  - startDelay: 0.18
    speaker: Young Man
    text: Mm-hm.
    holdSeconds: 2.2
    voiceClip: {fileID: 0}
    durationMode: 0
    voiceTailSeconds: 0.12
  - startDelay: 0.18
    speaker: Work Unit
    text: Want me to bring in last week's chart?
    holdSeconds: 4.1688676
    voiceClip: {fileID: 0}
    durationMode: 0
    voiceTailSeconds: 0.12
  - startDelay: 0.18
    speaker: Young Man
    text: Yeah, thanks.
    holdSeconds: 2.2
    voiceClip: {fileID: 0}
    durationMode: 0
    voiceTailSeconds: 0.12
  - startDelay: 0.18
    speaker: Work Unit
    text: You got it. Also, you've been sitting since three. How about two minutes
      on your feet?
    holdSeconds: 7.1877356
    voiceClip: {fileID: 0}
    durationMode: 0
    voiceTailSeconds: 0.12
  - startDelay: 0.18
    speaker: Young Man
    text: In a minute.
    holdSeconds: 2.2820754
    voiceClip: {fileID: 0}
    durationMode: 0
    voiceTailSeconds: 0.12
  - startDelay: 0.18
    speaker: Mia
    text: It's not just work. It handles all the little day-to-day stuff, too. I've
      been using mine that way for years.
    holdSeconds: 8.697169
    voiceClip: {fileID: 0}
    durationMode: 0
    voiceTailSeconds: 0.12
  postSequenceDelay: 0.18
